    CreateEffect(MODEL_SUMMONER_SUMMON_LAGUL, vTargetPos, vAngle, vLight, 0, NULL, iSummonLevel);
    int anRargle[3] = { 1, 2, 4 };
    for (int i = 0; i < anRargle[iSummonLevel]; ++i) {
        Vector(0.f, 0.f, i * 90.f, vAngle);
        CreateJoint(BITMAP_JOINT_SPIRIT, vTargetPos, vTargetPos, vAngle, 24, NULL, 100.f);
        CreateJoint(BITMAP_JOINT_SPIRIT, vTargetPos, vTargetPos, vAngle, 24, NULL, 20.f);
    }
    PlayBuffer(SOUND_SUMMOM_RARGLE);

The subtype-0 Lagul is an unseen spring of smoke and cloud at the target for 160 frames; each wide joint (Scale 100, so 100 / 70 = 1.43 and over the 0.9 the create arm asks) raises a seen Lagul, subtype 1, that rides it (ZzzEffectJoint.cpp:896-914). Four of each at the book's top tier, +11; two here, the +7 book's, as four Laguls are 5,020 triangles and ran the transparent pass past its 8,192 sprites in Aida (game/fx/pollution.h kJointsACast). Here the Ancient rune Pollution's (sim/items.h kPollution...), drawn by game/fx/pollution on what the realm struck.
